A cyberpunk digital illustration of a sleek iPad floating in a neon-drenched void, its screen emanating an intense deep purple glow that casts violet reflections across the surrounding darkness. Swirling streams of glowing data particles in electric blue and fierce red converge and merge into the purple light, suggesting transformation and rebirth. Behind the device, massive translucent lotus flowers bloom in shades of violet and magenta, their petals made of circuit-board patterns and fiber optic strands. The composition features dramatic contrast between the deep purple luminescence and the dark cybernetic environment, with holographic code fragments dissolving into purple mist around the edges. Rain streaks catch the colored light, creating a moody atmosphere of technological mystery and digital royalty.
